IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `esl-levy`

-- Emergency Services Levy Act 2002 (WA), read with Part 6A of the Fire and Emergency Services Act 1998 -- worked cases,
-- from the seat of the land owner.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case, a DFES or council levy notice, or the annual Gazette determination (not deposited): the
-- rates, minimum and maximum used are ILLUSTRATIVE.
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table (scratchpad gen_wa_emergency-services-levy-act-2002_baseline.py). Expected results were written by hand from the text.

§ `Fixtures`

`c055: Chloe and Liam's Byford house, 2029/30` MEANS `My land for the levy year` WITH
