§ `ESL Act s 3 -- the levy imposed`

#ASSERT NOT `Does the Emergency Services Levy Act itself fix how much levy I pay`

§ `FES Act ss 36B, 36D, 36E -- is my land leviable`

#ASSERT `Does another law exempt me from the levy` `land under a later Act expressly exempting its owner from the levy`

#ASSERT `Is my land leviable` `c055: Chloe and Liam's Byford house, 2029/30`
#ASSERT NOT `Is my land leviable` `land outside every ESL category area`
#ASSERT `Is my land leviable` `land under a later Act exempting from all rates and taxes, not naming the levy`

§ `FES Act ss 3A, 36P -- am I the one liable`

#ASSERT NOT `Am I an owner of the land` `mortgagee not in possession`
#ASSERT NOT `Am I an owner of the land` `tenant of freehold land`

#ASSERT `Am I liable to pay the levy` `registered proprietor of freehold land` `c055: Chloe and Liam's Byford house, 2029/30`
#ASSERT NOT `Am I liable to pay the levy` `tenant of freehold land` `c055: Chloe and Liam's Byford house, 2029/30`

#ASSERT `Can I be made to pay all of the levy on land I own with others` TRUE

#ASSERT `Is a notice served on my co-owner served on me` TRUE

